{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1539373439"}, "name":{"label":"Bloody eclipse"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-27T12:21:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14355513290"}, "title":{"label":"Some problems probably just me?"}, "content":{"label":"So I do love the game, but some problems being my cat likes to block the entrance to my own home until my character passes out, which sucks, and the amount of times I have to turn my phone so I can actually get to the other areas because of the black bar my phone has when I’m on a game, and sometimes I can’t find people in time for the quest limits on the amount of days. Which does suck but otherwise I love the game. It’s probably just me mostly having some problems like that. Maybe some others might have similar problems but so far in reviews I didn’t see anything mentioned like this..But I do love the game still despite the some problems I have.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
