{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id475570996"}, "name":{"label":"=^<"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-25T03:03:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14345862068"}, "title":{"label":"📉"}, "content":{"label":"I played Stardew Valley on my iPhone for a long time, and everything worked perfectly. After updating to the latest version, the game became unplayable.\nThe entire screen is zoomed in and cut off. The health and energy bars, the toolbar, and even the \"Loading...\" message are cut off and extend beyond the screen. Rescaling the interface doesn't solve the problem.\n\nI've already tried everything to fix the issue, but nothing has worked. The problem occurs in every save and even in new games.\n\nI'm using an iPhone 14 Pro Max with the latest version of the game. Please fix the screen scaling issue. I really love Stardew Valley and want to play again, but it's impossible now because the interface is cut off.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
