{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1832059252"}, "name":{"label":"Strmshrd32"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-02T08:32:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14254205878"}, "title":{"label":"🚨GLITCH ALERT!🚨"}, "content":{"label":"First of all, great game, but now on to the glitch. I was heading over to Leah’s Cottage to give her a salad on her birthday, because they’re her favorite, and I’ve already given her one this week. When I tried to give her another one the next day, it said I’ve already given her two gifts this week when in the relationships tab, I’ve only given her one! (not counting her birthday, as they shouldn’t count towards the weekly limit)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
