{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1882439246"}, "name":{"label":"turtle-jones"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-30T10:54:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14246128355"}, "title":{"label":"love it"}, "content":{"label":"this game is amazing and it’s perfect for anyone who wants a chill game or if you want some excitement, that is also available. my biggest problem is that (i play on an ipad) if i touch the bottom of the screen a few times, it’ll go mostly black and i have to quit and lose my progress. especially annoying at the end of a day. i saw somebody mentioning this bug, too. hopefully it gets fixed in 1.7. anyway THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR THIS AWESOME GAME CONCERNEDAPE I LOVE IT SO MUCH IF YOU DON’T PLAY IT PLEASE DO IT’S SOOOOO WORTH THE COST", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1425029928"}, "name":{"label":"Gabrus7_7"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-29T18:42:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14243181952"}, "title":{"label":"Interfaz"}, "content":{"label":"El juego es una maravilla tengo más de 300 horas entre la versión de Android y iPhone, sin ninguna duda es mi juego favorito el único problema que tengo con la versión de iPhone es que los diálogos son muy pequeños los botones, la barra de vida, energía y interfaz igualmente son muy pequeños por más grandes que ponga todas las opciones posibles, ya que tengo un iPhone 16 la isla dinámica también molesta en la barra de herramientas o donde está la fecha y hora entiendo que eso no es culta del juego pero me gustaría que hicieran algo con eso", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37632451"}, "name":{"label":"Jennifer Mento"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-29T07:27:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14241131401"}, "title":{"label":"My Childhood"}, "content":{"label":"Growing up, I played Harvest Moon nonstop on GBA. It was a game that I knew nothing about at the time but on a whim & some saved allowance money, bought it at Best Buy. It was THE game for me. The game I would play on rainy nights next to my mom & sister, outside after swimming all day in the pool, & on roadtrips to visit my family. \n\nFast forward to 2018ish, I was causally scrolling on Steam, looking for a game that was similar to the Harvest Moon of my childhood. Here I stumbled upon this prize of a game. It not only brought back the simplicity of childhood but open a new world of gaming mods to me. \n\nNow here we are, a computer, PS4, & mobile game version all purchased because I will always buy this game. The amount of hours you can play is insurmountable. The relax pace & creative freedom is the perfect way to spend a rainy day or a few hours before bed on a Sunday. \n\nConcerned Ape, thank you for making a game that bought back the core nostalgia I was chasing. You forever will have a patron for any & all your future gaming endeavors.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id572372901"}, "name":{"label":"Arios5114"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-29T07:14:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14241084000"}, "title":{"label":"Incredible game, wish the UI and controller support were a bit better"}, "content":{"label":"CONCERNED APE, LET ME ADJUST THE ENERGY BAR LOCATION AND MY LIFE IS YOURS!!! Also, it’d be nice if I didn’t need to use the touchscreen for certain things like sorting my inventory and scrolling through the villager menu.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1406007486"}, "name":{"label":"nate/hi✨🙃"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-28T17:44:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14238884348"}, "title":{"label":"Best Game"}, "content":{"label":"I personally love this game SO much, it’s insanely calming when I need it, and when I’m bored, it also gets me in a rush. Contradicting, I know, but seriously. My oldest sister is the one who got me into it, and now, I swear, I play it every day. My only thing, would probably be having heart events for the kids, depending on their parents? I dunno, I just think it’d be pretty cool.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
